Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dental groups with several offices around {City}. {Business Name} has strong reviews at its locations, but the site has one contact page, no booking by office and no careers section, while you're hiring.

I built a sample first rather than ask for a meeting: a location finder, a page per office with its team and hours, booking by location and dentist, an insurance and membership plan page and a careers hub, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I finish it in phases for {Build Range}, connected to your existing scheduling system, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. Your team approves every page before it publishes.

Worth twenty minutes with you and your operations lead?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
